OL,3,GNEWSANew food waste collections to
OL,4,Astart in Coventry
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in Coventry are being told to
OL,7,Fuse new bins for their food waste
OL,8,Finstead of putting it in with their
OL,9,Fregular household refuse.
OL,11,FThe new bins, delivered to homes across
OL,12,Fthe city over the past two months, are
OL,13,Fpart of a wider government strategy,
OL,14,Fbrought in by the Department for
OL,15,FEnvironment, Food and Rural Affairs
OL,16,F(Defra) in 2025.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
