OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1788251146
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSANew food waste collections to
OL,4,Astart in Coventry
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoventry City Council is the
OL,7,Fpenultimate local authority in Coventry
OL,8,Fand Warwickshire to introduce the
OL,9,Fchange, with Nuneaton and Bedworth
OL,10,FBorough Council still to bring its
OL,11,Fsystem in.
OL,13,FCollections in Coventry start on 7
OL,14,FSeptember, as long as the food waste is
OL,15,Fput out alongside the regular rubbish
OL,16,Fcollection on the scheduled bin day.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
